.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_GENERIC_GROK 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_generic_grok
.Nd orthogonal
.Xr mac 4
modules as loaded by
.Xr mac_generic_grok 8
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This page is the configured kernel view.
Implementations are the stock modules in
.Pa /boot/kernel
.Pq options MAC in GENERIC .
.Pp
Typical set with LOMAC:
.Xr mac_seeotheruids 4
with
.Va security.mac.seeotheruids.specificgid
set to 0
.Pq wheel
so operators still see the system.
.Pp
Do not load
.Xr mac_biba 4
or
.Xr mac_mls 4
next to
.Xr mac_lomac 4
unless a second information-flow proof is required.
.Pp
.Xr mac_ifoff 4
defaults in this package leave
.Va security.mac.ifoff.other_enabled
at 0, which can cut remote access.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac 4 ,
.Xr mac_seeotheruids 4 ,
.Xr mac_generic_grok 8 ,
.Xr mac_generic_grok 5
.Sh BUGS
.Va security.mac.seeotheruids.specificgid
is a single GID
.Pq Handbook; not a list .
.Va primarygroup_enabled
must not be combined with
.Va specificgid_enabled .
.Xr mac_ifoff 4
.Va other_enabled Ns =0
cuts non-loopback traffic.
.Xr mac_bsdextended 4
starts allow-all until
.Xr ugidfw 8
rules exist; new users need a module reload.
Labeled
.Xr mac_partition 4
historically failed
.Xr kldunload 8
with
.Er ENOMEM
while labels remained.
See the package
.Pa README
section
.Dq Known issues
for Handbook ch.19 troubleshooting and mailing-list/PR notes
.Pq kern/72263, bin/79714, Forums 76153 .
